/-!
# An erratum against CHVY25: the family's instances, `k = 13, …, 30` over `F_1217`

Data for `GordieHowe.Errata.CHVY25.Family`, generated from the family's construction: for
`k = BLOCK = NREQ + 1`, each table lists
every challenge `α = (k − 1)^(2k−1) − ∏_{q ≠ a, b} (k − 1 − node q)` reachable with agreement
`2k − 1`, once, with one pair `(a, b)` of left-out columns, sorted by the representative of `α`.
`P` is `∏_q (k − 1 − node q)`. Every fact (`Facts`) and every numerical comparison is checked by
`decide +kernel`.

`theorem44Summed_false_family` and `theorem44Summed_false_family_ncol` collect the instances: with
`t = NREQ = k − 1` (Longfellow's layout), the sum of the bounds of CHVY25 Theorems 4.3 and 4.4, as
transcribed in `GordieHowe.Errata.CHVY25`, fails for every `k` from `13` to `30` at `n = 2k + 1`, with the
code length read as `n` or as the full encoded length `4k`.
-/

namespace GordieHowe.Errata.CHVY25.Family

